// Call Of Duty: Black Ops II
>game,T6

// zomswell_donor - the two DLC5 ZOMBIE SWELL TECH SETS, copied verbatim out of
// Zombies Declassified BETA 1 zm_moon.ff (the patched OAT in tools\oat-dlc5
// reads that dev zone; the stock Linker cannot - see how_this_was_built.txt).
//
// WHY THIS EXISTS (measured 2026-09-12):
// The Wave Gun body swell is a VERTEX SHADER on Moon's zombie techsets, not a
// script trick. Retail's mc_sw4_3d_char_cloth_4z8fq5wu embeds
//     vertexShader 4.0 "pimp_shader_sw4_3d_phong_emissive_alcatraz_b7d697d7.hlsl"
// for its lit-spot technique, while DLC5's ..._dlc5 embeds
//     vertexShader 4.0 "pimp_shader_sw4_3d_char_cloth_53938792.hlsl"
// (pixel shader identical; every other field identical). The technique NAME is
// the same on both sides - only the embedded shader differs - so the retail
// techset can never swell no matter how the material is authored. These two
// techsets are the shader half; mod_wavegun_swell.zone's MaximumSwell
// materials are the data half.
techniqueset,mc_sw4_3d_char_cloth_4z8fq5wu_dlc5
techniqueset,mc_sw4_3d_char_skin_j92387z3_dlc5
